      "text": "Stumbled upon this cute little cafe by accident and absolutely loved it! Cozy ambience, friendly team, absolutely delicious desserts. We ordered green tea, latte, SSebastian cake, Lotus Biscoff cheesecake and tiramisu, all were fresh, tasty, generously portioned.",
